  {/* Vague desktop : même esprit que mobile, sans étirer tout le SVG */}
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-0 hidden h-[72px] lg:block xl:h-[84px]" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="h-full w-full" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 734 415 69" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="148" y="734" width="267" height="69" fill="#FFCFA5"></rect>
      <circle
        cx="34.5"
        cy="34.5"
        r="34.5"
        transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 183 734)"
        fill="#FFCFA5"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>

  {/* Content : absolute sur mobile, flow normal sur desktop */}
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 lg:static lg:inset-auto lg:z-auto">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-88 flex-col items-center px-7 pb-12 pt-16 text-center lg:h-auto lg:max-w-336 lg:items-start lg:px-8 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28 lg:text-left"
    >
      <h2
        class="mx-auto min-h-39 max-w-[18rem] text-center font-heading text-[2.25rem] font-bold uppercase leading-[1.05] text-orange lg:mx-0 lg:min-h-0 lg:mb-14 lg:max-w-none lg:text-left lg:whitespace-nowrap"
      >
        <span class="block lg:inline">L'administration</span>
        <span class="block lg:ml-2 lg:inline">bloque les</span>
        <span class="block lg:ml-2 lg:inline">jeunes</span>
      </h2>

      {/* Stats : empilées mobile, 3 colonnes desktop */}
      <div class="-translate-y-8 lg:translate-y-0 lg:w-full">
        <div class="mt-7 space-y-7 lg:space-y-0 lg:mygrid lg:items-start">

          <div class="mx-auto max-w-63 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-5 lg:mx-0 lg:flex lg:justify-center lg:max-w-none">
            <div class="lg:flex lg:max-w-[15.5rem] lg:items-start lg:gap-4">
              <img
                src={orangeDividerUrl}
                alt=""
                aria-hidden="true"
                loading="lazy"
                class="hidden lg:block lg:h-36 lg:w-auto lg:shrink-0"
              />
              <div>
                <p class="font-heading text-[3.5rem] font-bold leading-none text-orange">
                  37%
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3 font-sans text-base leading-tight text-orange">
                  des jeunes rencontrent des difficult&eacute;s dans leurs
                  d&eacute;marches administratives.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-auto max-w-59 lg:col-start-9 lg:col-span-5 lg:mx-0 lg:flex lg:justify-center lg:max-w-none">
            <div class="lg:flex lg:max-w-[15.5rem] lg:items-start lg:gap-4">
              <img
                src={orangeDividerUrl}
                alt=""
                aria-hidden="true"
                loading="lazy"
                class="hidden lg:block lg:h-36 lg:w-auto lg:shrink-0"
              />
              <div>
                <p class="font-heading text-[3.5rem] font-bold leading-none text-orange">
                  34%
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3 font-sans text-base leading-tight text-orange">
                  ne savent pas &agrave; quelles aides ils ont droit.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-auto max-w-63 lg:col-start-15 lg:col-span-5 lg:mx-0 lg:flex lg:justify-center lg:max-w-none">
            <div class="lg:flex lg:max-w-[15.5rem] lg:items-start lg:gap-4">
              <img
                src={orangeDividerUrl}
                alt=""
                aria-hidden="true"
                loading="lazy"
                class="hidden lg:block lg:h-36 lg:w-auto lg:shrink-0"
              />
              <div>
                <p class="font-heading text-[3.5rem] font-bold leading-none text-orange">
                  59%
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3 font-sans text-base leading-tight text-orange">
                  renoncent &agrave; certaines d&eacute;marches &agrave; cause de
                  leur complexit&eacute;.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:mt-12">
          <p
            class="mt-7 w-full text-left font-sans text-base leading-[1.55] text-orange lg:mt-0 lg:max-w-208"
          >
            Octy transforme donc les d&eacute;marches administratives en <span
              class="font-bold text-orange">parcours simples</span
            >
            pour <span class="font-bold text-orange"
              >comprendre le syst&egrave;me et agir</span
            >
            <span class="font-bold text-orange">en autonomie</span>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
